Package: nipovpn-dashboard
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Morteza Bashsiz
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-yaml
Recommends: nipovpn, openssl
Homepage: https://github.com/MortezaBashsiz/nipovpn-dashboard
Description: Web dashboard for managing a NipoVPN server
 A web page beside a nipovpn server to add, edit, disable and delete users,
 change server settings, watch usage and activity, and share agent configs,
 nipovpn:// links and QR codes with users.
 .
 It listens on 127.0.0.1:8090 by default and can serve HTTPS. Its settings
 are in /etc/nipovpn-dashboard/config.yaml; set a password there and start
 the nipovpn-dashboard service.
